{"seq":1,"slug":"delegation","title":"委托","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/kotlin-advanced/advanced-features/delegation","wordCount":579,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"委托\">委托</h1><p>委托（Delegation）是 Kotlin 中替代继承的核心设计模式。通过类委托（<code>by</code>）和属性委托（<code>by lazy</code>、<code>by observable</code> 等），Kotlin 在语言层面原生支持委托模式，让代码更加简洁、灵活和可组合。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>委托的核心是<strong>用组合替代继承</strong>：<code>by</code> 把接口方法的实现转交给另一个对象，属性委托则把 <code>get</code>/<code>set</code> 的读写转交给一个 <code>ReadWriteProperty</code>。它让「复用行为」不再绑定在类型层级上，而是变成可以被替换、组合的对象——类委托与 <code>lazy</code>、<code>observable</code>、Map 委托都属于这一机制。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"类委托\">类委托</h2><p>类委托通过 <code>by</code> 关键字，将接口的实现委托给另一个对象：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"interface Printer {&#10;    fun print(message: String)&#10;}&#10;&#10;class ConsolePrinter : Printer {&#10;    override fun print(message: String) = println(&quot;[控制台] $message&quot;)&#10;}&#10;&#10;class LoggingPrinter(private val delegate: Printer) : Printer by delegate {&#10;    override fun print(message: String) {&#10;        println(&quot;[日志] 即将打印: $message&quot;)&#10;        delegate.print(message) // 调用被委托对象&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;val printer = LoggingPrinter(ConsolePrinter())&#10;printer.print(&quot;Hello&quot;) // [日志] 即将打印: Hello \\n [控制台] Hello\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>interface Printer {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun print(message: String)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class ConsolePrinter : Printer {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override fun print(message: String) = println(\"[控制台] $message\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class LoggingPrinter(private val delegate: Printer) : Printer by delegate {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override fun print(message: String) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        println(\"[日志] 即将打印: $message\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        delegate.print(message) // 调用被委托对象</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val printer = LoggingPrinter(ConsolePrinter())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>printer.print(\"Hello\") // [日志] 即将打印: Hello \\n [控制台] Hello</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[客户端] --&gt;|调用| B[LoggingPrinter]&#10;    B --&gt;|委托| C[ConsolePrinter]&#10;    B --&gt;|可选覆盖| D[自定义行为]\">flowchart LR\n    A[客户端] --&gt;|调用| B[LoggingPrinter]\n    B --&gt;|委托| C[ConsolePrinter]\n    B --&gt;|可选覆盖| D[自定义行为]</pre><p>类委托编译后，编译器自动生成所有接口方法的转发代码。被覆盖的方法使用自定义实现，未覆盖的直接转发。</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 类委托遵循&quot;组合优于继承&quot;原则，一个类可以同时委托多个接口给不同对象。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"多接口委托\">多接口委托</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"interface Logger {&#10;    fun log(msg: String)&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface Metrics {&#10;    fun record(event: String, value: Double)&#10;}&#10;&#10;class ConsoleLogger : Logger {&#10;    override fun log(msg: String) = println(msg)&#10;}&#10;&#10;class InMemoryMetrics : Metrics {&#10;    override fun record(event: String, value: Double) {&#10;        println(&quot;$event: $value&quot;)&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;class Service(&#10;    logger: Logger,&#10;    metrics: Metrics&#10;) : Logger by logger, Metrics by metrics&#10;&#10;val service = Service(ConsoleLogger(), InMemoryMetrics())&#10;service.log(&quot;启动完成&quot;)&#10;service.record(&quot;latency&quot;, 42.0)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>interface Logger {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun log(msg: String)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>interface Metrics {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun record(event: String, value: Double)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class ConsoleLogger : Logger {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override fun log(msg: String) = println(msg)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class InMemoryMetrics : Metrics {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override fun record(event: String, value: Double) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        println(\"$event: $value\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class Service(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    logger: Logger,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    metrics: Metrics</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>) : Logger by logger, Metrics by metrics</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val service = Service(ConsoleLogger(), InMemoryMetrics())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>service.log(\"启动完成\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>service.record(\"latency\", 42.0)</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"属性委托\">属性委托</h2><p>属性委托通过 <code>by</code> 关键字将属性的 get/set 操作委托给另一个对象。</p>\n<h3 id=\"lazy-延迟初始化\">lazy — 延迟初始化</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"val heavyObject: HeavyResource by lazy {&#10;    println(&quot;初始化 HeavyResource&quot;)&#10;    HeavyResource()&#10;}&#10;// 首次访问时才初始化，后续访问使用缓存值\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>val heavyObject: HeavyResource by lazy {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println(\"初始化 HeavyResource\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    HeavyResource()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 首次访问时才初始化，后续访问使用缓存值</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>lazy</code> 的线程安全模式：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模式</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>LazyThreadSafetyMode.SYNCHRONIZED</code></td>\n<td>默认，线程安全</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>LazyThreadSafetyMode.PUBLICATION</code></td>\n<td>允许多线程同时计算，但只使用第一个结果</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>LazyThreadSafetyMode.NONE</code></td>\n<td>无同步，最快但不线程安全</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"observable-变化监听\">observable — 变化监听</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"import kotlin.properties.Delegates&#10;&#10;var name: String by Delegates.observable(&quot;初始值&quot;) { prop, old, new -&gt;&#10;    println(&quot;${prop.name}: $old -&gt; $new&quot;)&#10;}&#10;&#10;name = &quot;张三&quot; // name: 初始值 -&gt; 张三&#10;name = &quot;李四&quot; // name: 张三 -&gt; 李四\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import kotlin.properties.Delegates</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>var name: String by Delegates.observable(\"初始值\") { prop, old, new -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println(\"${prop.name}: $old -> $new\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>name = \"张三\" // name: 初始值 -> 张三</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>name = \"李四\" // name: 张三 -> 李四</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"vetoable-变化拦截\">vetoable — 变化拦截</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"var age: Int by Delegates.vetoable(0) { _, old, new -&gt;&#10;    new in 0..150 // 返回 false 则拒绝赋值&#10;}&#10;&#10;age = 25  // 接受&#10;age = -1  // 拒绝，age 仍为 25&#10;age = 200 // 拒绝，age 仍为 25\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>var age: Int by Delegates.vetoable(0) { _, old, new -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    new in 0..150 // 返回 false 则拒绝赋值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>age = 25  // 接受</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>age = -1  // 拒绝，age 仍为 25</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>age = 200 // 拒绝，age 仍为 25</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>委托类型</th>\n<th>触发时机</th>\n<th>可拦截</th>\n<th>典型用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>lazy</code></td>\n<td>首次读取</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>延迟初始化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>observable</code></td>\n<td>每次赋值后</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>变化通知/日志</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>vetoable</code></td>\n<td>每次赋值前</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>值验证/约束</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"自定义属性委托\">自定义属性委托</h2><p>实现 <code>ReadOnlyProperty</code> 或 <code>ReadWriteProperty</code> 接口来创建自定义委托：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"import kotlin.properties.ReadWriteProperty&#10;import kotlin.reflect.KProperty&#10;&#10;class TrimmedString : ReadWriteProperty&lt;Any?, String&gt; {&#10;    private var value: String = &quot;&quot;&#10;&#10;    override fun getValue(thisRef: Any?, property: KProperty&lt;*&gt;): String = value&#10;&#10;    override fun setValue(thisRef: Any?, property: KProperty&lt;*&gt;, value: String) {&#10;        this.value = value.trim()&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;class UserForm {&#10;    var username: String by TrimmedString()&#10;    var email: String by TrimmedString()&#10;}&#10;&#10;val form = UserForm()&#10;form.username = &quot;  admin  &quot;&#10;println(form.username) // &quot;admin&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import kotlin.properties.ReadWriteProperty</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import kotlin.reflect.KProperty</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class TrimmedString : ReadWriteProperty&#x3C;Any?, String> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private var value: String = \"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override fun getValue(thisRef: Any?, property: KProperty&#x3C;*>): String = value</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override fun setValue(thisRef: Any?, property: KProperty&#x3C;*>, value: String) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        this.value = value.trim()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class UserForm {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    var username: String by TrimmedString()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    var email: String by TrimmedString()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val form = UserForm()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>form.username = \"  admin  \"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>println(form.username) // \"admin\"</span></span></code></pre></div><p>更简洁的写法使用运算符函数：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"class Cached&lt;T&gt;(private val compute: () -&gt; T) {&#10;    private var cachedValue: T? = null&#10;&#10;    operator fun getValue(thisRef: Any?, property: KProperty&lt;*&gt;): T {&#10;        return cachedValue ?: compute().also { cachedValue = it }&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;val expensiveResult by Cached { performHeavyCalculation() }\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>class Cached&#x3C;T>(private val compute: () -> T) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private var cachedValue: T? = null</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    operator fun getValue(thisRef: Any?, property: KProperty&#x3C;*>): T {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return cachedValue ?: compute().also { cachedValue = it }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val expensiveResult by Cached { performHeavyCalculation() }</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"map-委托\">Map 委托</h2><p>Kotlin 支持将属性委托给 Map，非常适合解析动态数据：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"class Config(map: Map&lt;String, Any?&gt;) {&#10;    val host: String by map&#10;    val port: Int by map&#10;    val debug: Boolean by map&#10;}&#10;&#10;val config = Config(&#10;    mapOf(&#10;        &quot;host&quot; to &quot;localhost&quot;,&#10;        &quot;port&quot; to 8080,&#10;        &quot;debug&quot; to true&#10;    )&#10;)&#10;&#10;println(config.host) // localhost&#10;println(config.port) // 8080\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>class Config(map: Map&#x3C;String, Any?>) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val host: String by map</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val port: Int by map</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val debug: Boolean by map</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val config = Config(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    mapOf(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        \"host\" to \"localhost\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        \"port\" to 8080,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        \"debug\" to true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>println(config.host) // localhost</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>println(config.port) // 8080</span></span></code></pre></div><p>可变版本使用 <code>MutableMap</code>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"class MutableConfig(map: MutableMap&lt;String, Any?&gt;) {&#10;    var host: String by map&#10;    var port: Int by map&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>class MutableConfig(map: MutableMap&#x3C;String, Any?>) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    var host: String by map</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    var port: Int by map</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[属性委托选择] --&gt; B{需求类型?}&#10;    B --&gt;|延迟初始化| C[by lazy]&#10;    B --&gt;|变化监听| D[by observable]&#10;    B --&gt;|赋值验证| E[by vetoable]&#10;    B --&gt;|动态数据映射| F[by map]&#10;    B --&gt;|自定义逻辑| G[自定义 ReadWriteProperty]\">flowchart TD\n    A[属性委托选择] --&gt; B{需求类型?}\n    B --&gt;|延迟初始化| C[by lazy]\n    B --&gt;|变化监听| D[by observable]\n    B --&gt;|赋值验证| E[by vetoable]\n    B --&gt;|动态数据映射| F[by map]\n    B --&gt;|自定义逻辑| G[自定义 ReadWriteProperty]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"实际应用-sharedpreferences-委托\">实际应用：SharedPreferences 委托</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"class PreferenceDelegate&lt;T&gt;(&#10;    private val prefs: SharedPreferences,&#10;    private val key: String,&#10;    private val defaultValue: T&#10;) : ReadWriteProperty&lt;Any?, T&gt; {&#10;&#10;    @Suppress(&quot;UNCHECKED_CAST&quot;)&#10;    override fun getValue(thisRef: Any?, property: KProperty&lt;*&gt;): T {&#10;        return when (defaultValue) {&#10;            is String -&gt; prefs.getString(key, defaultValue) as T&#10;            is Int -&gt; prefs.getInt(key, defaultValue) as T&#10;            is Boolean -&gt; prefs.getBoolean(key, defaultValue) as T&#10;            is Long -&gt; prefs.getLong(key, defaultValue) as T&#10;            else -&gt; throw IllegalArgumentException(&quot;不支持的类型&quot;)&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    override fun setValue(thisRef: Any?, property: KProperty&lt;*&gt;, value: T) {&#10;        prefs.edit().apply {&#10;            when (value) {&#10;                is String -&gt; putString(key, value)&#10;                is Int -&gt; putInt(key, value)&#10;                is Boolean -&gt; putBoolean(key, value)&#10;                is Long -&gt; putLong(key, value)&#10;            }&#10;            apply()&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;class Settings(prefs: SharedPreferences) {&#10;    var username: String by PreferenceDelegate(prefs, &quot;username&quot;, &quot;&quot;)&#10;    var darkMode: Boolean by PreferenceDelegate(prefs, &quot;dark_mode&quot;, false)&#10;    var fontSize: Int by PreferenceDelegate(prefs, &quot;font_size&quot;, 14)&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>class PreferenceDelegate&#x3C;T>(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val prefs: SharedPreferences,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val key: String,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val defaultValue: T</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>) : ReadWriteProperty&#x3C;Any?, T> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Suppress(\"UNCHECKED_CAST\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override fun getValue(thisRef: Any?, property: KProperty&#x3C;*>): T {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return when (defaultValue) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            is String -> prefs.getString(key, defaultValue) as T</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            is Int -> prefs.getInt(key, defaultValue) as T</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            is Boolean -> prefs.getBoolean(key, defaultValue) as T</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            is Long -> prefs.getLong(key, defaultValue) as T</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            else -> throw IllegalArgumentException(\"不支持的类型\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override fun setValue(thisRef: Any?, property: KProperty&#x3C;*>, value: T) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        prefs.edit().apply {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            when (value) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                is String -> putString(key, value)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                is Int -> putInt(key, value)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                is Boolean -> putBoolean(key, value)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                is Long -> putLong(key, value)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            apply()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class Settings(prefs: SharedPreferences) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    var username: String by PreferenceDelegate(prefs, \"username\", \"\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    var darkMode: Boolean by PreferenceDelegate(prefs, \"dark_mode\", false)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    var fontSize: Int by PreferenceDelegate(prefs, \"font_size\", 14)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>类委托</strong>通过 <code>by</code> 将接口实现委托给另一个对象，实现&quot;组合优于继承&quot;</li>\n<li>一个类可以同时委托多个接口给不同对象</li>\n<li><strong>lazy</strong> 延迟初始化，<strong>observable</strong> 监听变化，<strong>vetoable</strong> 验证并拦截赋值</li>\n<li><strong>自定义委托</strong>通过实现 <code>ReadWriteProperty</code> 或运算符函数创建</li>\n<li><strong>Map 委托</strong>适合解析 JSON、配置文件等动态数据</li>\n<li>属性委托在 Android 开发中广泛用于 SharedPreferences、ViewModel、Bundle 等场景</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"委托","id":"委托"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"类委托","id":"类委托"},{"level":2,"text":"多接口委托","id":"多接口委托"},{"level":2,"text":"属性委托","id":"属性委托"},{"level":3,"text":"lazy — 延迟初始化","id":"lazy-延迟初始化"},{"level":3,"text":"observable — 变化监听","id":"observable-变化监听"},{"level":3,"text":"vetoable — 变化拦截","id":"vetoable-变化拦截"},{"level":2,"text":"自定义属性委托","id":"自定义属性委托"},{"level":2,"text":"Map 委托","id":"map-委托"},{"level":2,"text":"实际应用：SharedPreferences 委托","id":"实际应用-sharedpreferences-委托"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"平台 API 访问","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/kotlin-advanced/multiplatform/platform-apis"},"next":{"title":"契约","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/kotlin-advanced/advanced-features/contracts"}}